<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH PM SIGNS INVESTMENT MEASURE WITH MALAYSIA.</title>
<headline>CZECH PM SIGNS INVESTMENT MEASURE WITH MALAYSIA.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic on Monday signed a bilateral agreement on investment support and protection with Malaysia, Czech radio reported from Kuala Lumpur.</p>
<p>It was signed by Czech Prime Minister Vaclav Klaus and his Malaysian counterpart Mahathir Mohamad.</p>
<p>Klaus, who began a three-day visit on Sunday, also met Malaysian ruler Tuanku Jaafar today, the radio said.</p>
</text>
